English screenshots are intentionally absent.

The app cannot render an English UI today: lib/app/locale_resolver.dart returns
Locale('es','AR') unconditionally, because intl_en.arb is a codegen scaffold
with empty values. Serving it renders blank strings (ADR-I18N-005).

Screenshots in English are blocked on that i18n work, not on this directory.
Once the app can render English, drop the PNGs here following the same device
folders used under ../es/ and delete this file.

See store/README.md.
